Customer-Segmentation-using-KMeans

Better Understanding of Customers: Used K-means clustering to group customers based on their spending score , annual income and demographics, making it easier to target specific groups with personalized marketing.

Smarter Business Choices: The project helped identify key customer groups, allowing the business to focus its resources more effectively and make better decisions to boost overall success.

Used various Python libraries like Numpy, Pandas, Sklearn, Matplotlib and Seaborn.
